++### O4 — Compositor: composite what is dirty, sleep when nothing is
++
++**Objective:** finish what H1 started (Fact 3): the dirty union should
++bound the *work*, not just the flip — and the frame loop should block, not
++yield-spin.
++
++Tasks:
